@startuml
|TeamMember|
start
:Access to-do list and task list page;
:Display interface with options to add, edit, delete tasks;

|ToDoListInterface|
:Create new to-do list or task;
:Request to create task;

|TaskController|
:Create task;

|NotificationService|
:Send notification of new task creation;

|ToDoListInterface|
:Display updated task list;

|TeamMember|
:Assign task to a team member;

|TaskController|
:Assign task to assignee;

|NotificationService|
:Send notification of new task assignment;

|TeamMember|
:Receive notification of new task assignment;
:Update/Remove task;

|ToDoListInterface|
:Request of update/remove task from list;

|TaskController|
:Update/Remove task from database;

|ToDoListInterface|
:Display updated task list;

|NotificationService|
:Send reminders for upcoming deadlines and status changes;

|TeamMember|
:Receive reminder notifications;
:Display task progress and updates;

stop
@enduml